    "sections": {
        "description": "The Interior Design Studio WordPress Theme is a versatile and visually appealing theme tailored for interior designers, architects, and design studios. It is designed to showcase a wide range of interior design services, from cosy and classic interior design for apartments to luxurious designs for hotels, restaurants, and retail spaces. The theme is ideal for professionals offering interior design consultation online or through in-person meetings, allowing designers to promote their portfolios, share design inspiration, and connect with potential clients. Whether you're working on residential projects like small homes or luxury houses or commercial projects like salons, showrooms, or spas, this theme is built to highlight your expertise and showcase your work. Visually, the theme boasts a clean, modern design that emphasizes high-quality images and design aesthetics. Its responsive layout ensures that your website looks stunning on any device, whether on desktops, tablets, or smartphones. The theme includes customizable features, including sections for interior design renderings, mood boards, and project timelines. It also offers integration with social media, allowing you to promote your blog, interior design tips, and latest trends. Whether you're showcasing interior design mockups, sharing 3D renderings, or offering virtual interior design consultations, this theme provides all the necessary tools to create a professional, engaging website that speaks to your audience."
    },
